{
  "_note": [
    "Every long-running arcade service, in one place.",
    "",
    "This list used to be written out longhand in four files, and they had drifted:",
    "chat-server.py's status panel knew nothing about Chess or Aggravation,",
    "start-all.sh never started Aggravation at all, and only the health bot had",
    "the full set. Consumers now read this file instead of keeping their own copy:",
    "",
    "  arcade/chat-server.py            — status panel (entries with kind 'game')",
    "  arcade/start-all.sh              — launches every entry locally",
    "  arcade/scripts/bot-check-services.sh — probes every entry's port",
    "",
    "arcade/scripts/nginx-magmacrunch.conf still spells out its own proxy blocks",
    "(each needs a full stanza), but 'path' here is the name<->port mapping it",
    "must agree with.",
    "",
    "Not listed: admin (8780/8781), private, and mcp (8785). They take no --port",
    "argument and are not started by start-all.sh; their units live in",
    "arcade/admin/systemd and arcade/private/systemd.",
    "",
    "Adding a game: add an entry here, a systemd unit in arcade/systemd/, and a",
    "location block in the nginx conf."
  ],
  "services": [
    {
      "id": "sorry",
      "name": "SORRY",
      "kind": "game",
      "dir": "SORRY",
      "exec": "server.py",
      "port": 8765,
      "path": "/sorry",
      "unit": "arcade-sorry"
    },
    {
      "id": "cribbage",
      "name": "Cribbage",
      "kind": "game",
      "dir": "cribbage",
      "exec": "server.py",
      "port": 8766,
      "path": "/cribbage",
      "unit": "arcade-cribbage"
    },
    {
      "id": "stud",
      "name": "Scandinavian Stud",
      "kind": "game",
      "dir": "scandinavian-stud",
      "exec": "server.py",
      "port": 8767,
      "path": "/stud",
      "unit": "arcade-stud"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat",
      "name": "Chat",
      "kind": "chat",
      "dir": ".",
      "exec": "chat-server.py",
      "port": 8768,
      "path": "/",
      "unit": "arcade-chat"
    },
    {
      "id": "chess",
      "name": "Chess",
      "kind": "game",
      "dir": "chess",
      "exec": "server.py",
      "port": 8769,
      "path": "/chess",
      "unit": "arcade-chess"
    },
    {
      "id": "checkers",
      "name": "Checkers",
      "kind": "game",
      "dir": "checkers",
      "exec": "server.py",
      "port": 8770,
      "path": "/checkers",
      "unit": "arcade-checkers"
    },
    {
      "id": "backgammon",
      "name": "Backgammon",
